  "name": "Turkey Noodle Salad",
  "subtitle": "Rice noodles, vegetables, herbs, and spicy peanut dressing",
  "description": "A crisp, savory noodle salad combining shredded cooked turkey with fresh vegetables and a bright, spicy peanut dressing.",
